  },
  {
    q: 'How do I know which of these good career options actually fits me?',
    a: "Start by testing your real options against the same five factors any career should be judged on — income ceiling, security, growth trajectory, AI-resilience, and life-fit demand. The 5-Axis Good-Career Test linked below walks through exactly how to score your own shortlist, rather than picking from a generic ranking.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Should I pick a career based on this list, or based on what is rising fastest?',
    a: "Use both lenses for a real decision. This page maps the breadth of genuinely good, established options across every major field in India. If you specifically want the forward-looking view — which fields AI, cybersecurity, healthcare demand, and the energy transition are pushing upward right now — the future-careers guide linked below covers that angle in depth.",
  },
];

const faqJsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faqItems.map((item) => ({
